ress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=b5e1684940d9ee7afb46be33f10fcc4f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ab5537b0/uploads/origins/53c433be-73ab-4307-9b65-f7788169f6f5?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=42ec2bf3a8663d699fb63b20d6818886 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Hello Fe San! \n\nI love your amazing and cute art so much. \n\nCan I please ask for an illustration of Camilla and Beres Sensei from Fire Emblem. \n\nPlease draw them together in a cute pose, wearing any clothes you'd like.\n\nThey are both my favorite characters in the whole series. \n\nDraw them both with big soft breasts, and fluffy hair, standing side by side, looking at the viewer with a warm happy smile. \n\nThank you so much Fe San and thank you for everything you do!", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@fe135700/works/48", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/d7b32c5a/uploads/origins/adab80ab-9e95-4aed-a7a3-0b7417adb0e7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4a0857fea18908d3fbe919aa158c75f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/d7b32c5a/uploads/origins/adab80ab-9e95-4aed-a7a3-0b7417adb0e7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=d4a0857fea18908d3fbe919aa158c75f, https://si.imgix.net/d7b32c5a/uploads/origins/adab80ab-9e95-4aed-a7a3-0b7417adb0e7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a9101802a082e0a166a1833a38838a91 2x, https://si.imgix.net/d7b32c5a/uploads/origins/adab80ab-9e95-4aed-a7a3-0b7417adb0e7?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=bfc118bc7a4f60d7fd6919fb2c707a88 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "FEヒーローズのフィヨルムの姉、スリーズさんを描いていただきたいです。\n以前Twitter（X）に上げていた水着のフィヨルムのイラストと対照的になるような形の構図で\n身体を少し伸ばしてスリーズさん自身のスタイルの良さを強調して欲しいです。\n衣装は少し大人っぽい水着に全体的に明るい色のデザインが良いです。\nまた、サングラス等の小物や、少しだけセクシーな表情の差分まで付けていただけると嬉しいです。\nよろしくお願いします！\n\nhttps://x.com/fe135700/status/1944011441